/*
  VersionSegment.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0181 · VersionSegment (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The keys in the first block mirror the web
  source (components/layout/status-bar/VersionSegment.tsx) one-for-one — the tooltip + aria version
  label, the uptime + unseen-changelog hints, the update-available label, the modal title + provenance
  labels, the update banner, and the three action labels. The remaining keys are the native P4 leaf
  chrome (loading / empty / error pills, the open hint, and the freshness axis) so the Swift sources hold
  no English literals.

  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are
  kept in a per-surface table ("VersionSegment") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog. In test / preview bundles `NSLocalizedString` returns the value
  below, keeping the labels deterministic.
*/

/* --- Web source keys (VersionSegment.tsx) --- */
